  "body": "There are websites out there that use WebSocket to load the content, and therefore a WebSocket connection is on the critical path.\r\n\r\nI propose preloading/preconnecting for WebSocket (wss://) connection. It would establish the connection and buffer all the incoming messages. Once the actual WebSocket oject is created in JavaScript, those messages would fire in quick succession.",
